stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> idle
  idle --> queued: inputs ready
  queued --> running: dispatch
  queued --> paused_before: breakpoint / pause
  paused_before --> running: continue / step
  running --> done: T2
  running --> paused_after: after-breakpoint
  running --> stopped: stop accepted
  running --> interrupted_unknown: motion crash / timeout
  done --> queued: next loop round
